! PLAYER~TURNOFFANSI

Turns ANSI off through the shared player prompt path.

''Include:'' [[player.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/player.ts:1167`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
send &quot;c n&quot;
killalltriggers
waiton &quot;(1) ANSI graphics&quot;
getword CURRENTLINE $PLAYER~ANSISTATUS 5
waiton &quot;(2) Animation display&quot;
getword CURRENTLINE $PLAYER~ANIMATIONSTATUS 5
if ($PLAYER~ANIMATIONSTATUS = &quot;On&quot;)
</pre>

